cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "openquake.fdha: Python tools for probabilistic fault displacement hazard analysis"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for performing Probabilistic Fault Displacement Hazard
  Analysis (PFDHA) built on the OpenQuake Engine, providing a command-line
  interface to compute fault-displacement hazard curves and maps with an
  extensible library of published primary and secondary surface-rupture and
  displacement models.
type: software
authors:
